* [[Plague City]]: 1 × spade to dig [[Dug hole#mud patch|mud patch]]
* [[X Marks the Spot]]:  1 × spade to find clues and treasure
* [[Beneath Cursed Sands]]: 1 x spade for a chest
* [[The Corsair Curse]]: 1 x spade to dig up the doll
* [[Cold War]]: 1 x spade to finish your lookout
* [[Creature of Fenkenstrain]]: 1 x spade for various body parts
* [[Dragon Slayer II]]: 1 x spade for a dragon key piece
* [[Fairytale I - Growing Pains]]: 1 x spade for the draynor skull and potentially red vine worm
* [[Garden of Tranquillity]]: 1 x spade for farming throughout the quest
* [[In Aid of the Myreque]]: 1 x spade to clear mined piles of rubble
* [[Lunar Diplomacy]]:  1 x spade to dig up the lunar ring
* [[Making History]]: 1 x spade to dig up a chest
* [[My Arm's Big Adventure]]: 1 x spade for preparing the herb patch and to help My Arm harvest his goutweed
* [[Shilo Village]]: 1 x spade to clear the mound of earth covering the fissure
* [[Underground Pass]]: 1 x spade to navigate the underground pass
* [[Regicide]]: 1 x spade for navigating the underground pass
* [[Roving Elves]]: 1 x spade to bury glarial's seed to lay her spirit to rest
* [[Song of the Elves]]: 1 x spade for digging up multiple clue scrolls

