A '''knife''' is a multi-functional tool used for a large variety of tasks, primarily used for fletching [[logs]] in the [[Fletching]] skill and cutting food in the [[Cooking]] skill. It sees secondary usage in the [[Crafting]] skill. Additionally, it can be used to cut through [[Web|webs]] and setup [[Hunter]] traps. 

They are sold in many [[general store]]s, at [[Trader Stan's Trading Post]] on [[Karamja]], or the [[Ardougne Spice Stall]]. A knife can also be found by searching a sack between two webs in front of the lever to the [[Mage Arena bank]], if the player does not have a knife in their inventory.

==Uses==
===Quests===
*[[Plague City]]: 1 × knife to make [[chocolate dust]] (alternatively [[pestle and mortar]])
*[[Elemental Workshop I]]: 1 × knife to make [[slashed book]] and [[battered key]]
*[[Recipe for Disaster]] ([[Recipe for Disaster/Freeing Pirate Pete|Freeing Pirate Pete]] subquest): 1 × knife to make [[breadcrumbs]]
*[[A Porcine of Interest]]: 1 × knife (alternatively any [[slash weapon]] except [[abyssal whip]], [[abyssal tentacle]], or [[dragon claws]])
*[[Below Ice Mountain]]: 1 × knife to make [[steak sandwich]]

===Miniquests===
*[[Skippy and the Mogres]]: 1 × knife to make chocolate dust (alternatively pestle and mortar)

===Other===
*Slashing webs. (Note: As opposed to the knife, any tier of the [[Wilderness sword]] or any weapon with a slash bonus of at least +100 has a 100% success-rate)
*Cutting [[Kharidian cactus|cacti]] in the [[Kharidian Desert]] to fill [[waterskin]]s.
*Setting up [[deadfall]] and [[pitfall]] traps with the [[Hunter]] skill.
*Cutting open [[Giant egg sac]] and [[Scaly blue dragonhide]] (while at a bank).

