== Trivia ==
*Before ''RuneScape'' first launched in 2001, the knife was originally intended to be wieldable as a weapon. Although the option to wield it was removed before launch, its code with weapon stats still remained. For a brief time there was a bug where players could wield the knife, and also wield multiple knives at once, stacking their stats and giving them an insane strength bonus. This glitch has since been patched. (See {{RSCL|knife bug}})

