A '''bucket''' is one of the most common items available. They can be purchased cheaply from most [[general store]]s and can also be found in many locations throughout the game. Buckets are commonly used for [[skills]] such as [[Crafting]], [[Cooking]] and [[Farming]].

Buckets can contain any of the following items:

{{div col}}
*[[Water]]
*[[Bucket of sand|Sand]]
*[[Milk]] or [[Chocolatey milk]]
*[[Compost]], [[Supercompost]], or [[Ultracompost]]
*[[Slime]]
*[[Apple mush]]
*[[Bucket of sandworms|Sandworms]]
*Various quest items such as [[Bucket of wax|wax]], [[Bucket of sap|sap]], a [[hangover cure]], [[Ugthanki dung|camel dung]], and [[weird gloop]]
{{div col end}}

The fastest way to obtain buckets in bulk is to purchase [[empty bucket pack]]s containing 100 noted empty buckets. These packs can be bought at [[general store]]s and [[farming shop]]s for 500–875 [[coins]] each depending on the stock available.

Another way to quickly obtain an inventory of buckets is to search a [[Larder space|larder]] in a [[player-owned house]], remove [[Bucket of milk|buckets of milk]] and then right-click to "empty" them. This is also the fastest way to get milk.

Note that one may deposit and withdraw up to 1000 buckets from the [[tool leprechaun]]s located at almost every [[Farming/Patch locations|Farming patch]]; no [[Farming]] level is required to do this.

