'''Red spiders' eggs''' are a [[Herblore]] ingredient that [[members]] can use to make one of three different potions. Those with level 22 Herblore can combine them with a [[harralander potion (unf)]] (made by adding [[harralander]] to a [[vial of water]]) to make a [[restore potion]] and gain 62.5 [[experience]] points. Those with level 63 Herblore can combine the eggs with a [[snapdragon potion (unf)]] (made by adding [[snapdragon]] to a vial of water) to make a [[Super restore|super restore potion]] and gain 142.5 experience. Those with level 73 herblore can combine the eggs with [[coconut milk]] and a [[cactus spine]] to make [[weapon poison(+)]] and gain 190 experience.

All players can give red spiders' eggs along with a [[limpwurt root]] and 5 [[coins]] to the [[apothecary]] in [[Varrock]], and he will give them a 4-dose [[strength potion]] in return.

