A '''small fishing net''' is used to catch [[fish]] such as [[raw shrimps|shrimps]] and [[raw anchovies|anchovies]] at [[Fishing spot (small net, bait)|fishing spots]]; [[Raw karambwanji|karambwanji]] at fishing spots in the [[Holy Lake]]; [[minnow]]s at [[Fishing spot (minnow)|fishing spots]] on the [[Fishing Guild#Minnow platform|minnow platform]]; and [[raw monkfish|monkfish]] at [[Fishing spot (Piscatoris Fishing Colony)|fishing spots]] in Piscatoris. Nets can be purchased from various [[fishing shops]] for 5 [[coins]]. It can also be obtained for free from either the [[Fishing tutor]] south of [[Lumbridge]] near the coast east of the [[Lumbridge Swamp|swamp]], or from the [[Spirit Angler (Reward pool)|Spirit Angler]] at the [[Ruins of Unkah]].

The small fishing net can be combined with [[rope]] to make the [[net trap (item)|net trap]] used in the [[Hunter]] [[Skills|skill]] to capture [[swamp lizard]]s and [[salamander]]s.

